m/v/t64.5771-25/38982619_709619540446958_1947670398060919437_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=7f3OYSl0hGsQ7kNvwEKppWd&_nc_oc=AdrYdvhy8zmlqU0J1yYAyXGy60YvZiEKCX8o8kzggMLepYxdx0TF2pgg7PEI--Cbq5c&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af6CThSEIJ9RoliBAljCF-S9nwF-x_P_3Fz_YkHrpJDcxw&oe=6A00750E"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Cover_Trailer_crazy_cook_32bit.png", "id": "1038189767039681", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974677_1038189780373013_631460889995462255_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Hx-Cc53KVbIQ7kNvwFMKzNF&_nc_oc=AdrGqNSRa9YsR9d-rC5pnTrwQS3-KmWq-0c1eXTNrOIIrywNgCzpnqobAkDSUpoLQGY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af6badLUYt0EdGdYXyMcSBrHRWsrfhFsdXUpI2TdNg5o_Q&oe=6A00A503"}, "display_name": "Crazy Cook", "keywords": ["cooking", "party", "family", "crazy", "cook"], "long_description": "Crazy Cook\u00ae is a fun and crazy cooking game in VR for the whole family !\nYour goal is to create great recipes\u2026with a twist : the ingredients are a bit hostile !\nSlice a chickenosaurus, peel a smiling onion, avoid a killer tomato, smash a garlic grenade with a hammer or pepper spray (literally) a flying punk pig : that's part of your job as a master chef.\nAre you ready to slice with a knife (workshop 1), peel or block with a peeler (workshop 2), smash with a hammer (workshop 3), season or shoot with a one-of-a-kind salt mill (workshop 4) or avoid monsterish ingredients coming from a canon with your wild kitchen tools to score the top of the charts ?\n10 recipes, with 4 workshops each, are included : that's 40 ways to have crazy fun ! \nFor now it's a solo game but we are working on making it a multiplayer game. \nIt's only the beginning ! We will regularly add new features, music, recipes, new tools and new workshops. \nThank you for purchasing the game. It means the world !", "short_description": "Crazy Cook\u00ae 